[31m[1mError: [22mInvalid client module[39m

The `client_module` setting in the `[tools.dream_sql_generator]` table of
[4mgleam.toml[24m is `"Dream-Postgres-Client"`, which is not a valid Gleam
module name.

Hint: A module name is made of lowercase names separated by slashes, like
`dream_postgres_client` or `my_app/database`. Each name starts with a lowercase
letter and can only contain lowercase letters, numbers and underscores.
